{"sample_id": "sample_001", "audio": "audio/sample_001.m4a", "text": "사과 한 봉지에 만 원으로 등록해 줘.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_01", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_002", "audio": "audio/sample_002.m4a", "text": "사과 가격 육천 원으로 바꿔.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_01", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_003", "audio": "audio/sample_003.m4a", "text": "사과 오천 원, 아니 육천 원으로 바꿔.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id":"speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_01", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_004", "audio": "audio/sample_004.m4a", "text": "고구마 반 킬로에 이천오백 원.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_01", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_005", "audio": "audio/sample_005.m4a", "text": "딸기 이십 퍼센트 할인.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_01", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_006", "audio": "audio/sample_006.m4a", "text": "딸기 할인 삼십 퍼센트로 바꿔.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_01", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_007", "audio": "audio/sample_007.m4a", "text": "딸기 다 팔렸어. 품절 처리해줘.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_01", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_008", "audio": "audio/sample_008.m4a", "text": "사과 상품 삭제해줘.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_01", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_009", "audio": "audio/sample_009.m4a", "text": "딸기 할인 끝.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_01", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_010", "audio": "audio/sample_010.m4a", "text": "사과 삭제하지 마.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_01", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_011", "audio": "audio/sample_011.m4a", "text": "사과 등록해 줘.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_01", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_012", "audio": "audio/sample_012.m4a", "text": "한 봉지 만 원이야.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_01", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_013", "audio": "audio/sample_013.m4a", "text": "배 다섯 개에 만 원으로 등록해 줘.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_01", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_014", "audio": "audio/sample_014.m4a", "text": "감자 일 킬로에 삼천 원 등록.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_01", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_015", "audio": "audio/sample_015.m4a", "text": "시금치 한 단에 이천 원으로 등록해 줘.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_01", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_016", "audio": "audio/sample_016.m4a", "text": "계란 한 팩에 육천 원으로 등록해 줘.", "environment": "quiet", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_017", "audio": "audio/sample_017.m4a", "text": "고등어 두 마리에 오천 원.", "environment": "market", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_018", "audio": "audio/sample_018.m4a", "text": "고구마 오 백 그램에 삼천 원으로 등록.", "environment": "market", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_019", "audio": "audio/sample_019.m4a", "text": "양파 한 봉지에 이천오백 원으로 등록해 줘.", "environment": "market", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_020", "audio": "audio/sample_020.m4a", "text": "오이 다섯 개짜리 상품 가격을 사천 원으로 바꿔.", "environment": "market", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_021", "audio": "audio/sample_021.m4a", "text": "사과 열 개짜리 묶음 상품의 남은 재고를 여덟 묶음으로 바꿔.", "environment": "market", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_022", "audio": "audio/sample_022.m4a", "text": "사과 한 봉지에 오천 원, 아니 육천 원으로 등록해 줘.", "environment": "market", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_023", "audio": "audio/sample_023.m4a", "text": "감자 일 킬로, 아니 이 킬로에 오천 원으로 등록해 줘.", "environment": "market", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_024", "audio": "audio/sample_024.m4a", "text": "배 다섯 개, 아니 세 개에 육천 원으로 등록해.", "environment": "market", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_025", "audio": "audio/sample_025.m4a", "text": "고구마 반 킬로에 이천 원, 아니 이천오백 원으로 등록.", "environment": "market", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_026", "audio": "audio/sample_026.m4a", "text": "딸기 이십 퍼센트, 아니 삼십 퍼센트 할인해 줘.", "environment": "market", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_027", "audio": "audio/sample_027.m4a", "text": "딸기 할인 가격 칠천 원, 아니 육천 원으로 바꿔 줘.", "environment": "market", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_028", "audio": "audio/sample_028.m4a", "text": "딸기 오늘 저녁 일곱 시까지 이십 퍼센트 할인.", "environment": "market", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_029", "audio": "audio/sample_029.m4a", "text": "사과 가격을 만 이천오백 원으로 바꿔 줘.", "environment": "market", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_030", "audio": "audio/sample_030.m4a", "text": "방금 요청한거 취소.", "environment": "market", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
{"sample_id": "sample_032", "audio": "audio/sample_032.m4a", "text": "이십 퍼센트로 해 줘.", "environment": "market", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "session_id": "session_20261111_02", "split": "development", "audio_text_verified": true}
